[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; c_e2_lodge: the Emberwatch war-room table. A trestle top with a map of Emberfall (the burnt observatory inked at its
; centre) and the three relics on it, Ember Crown, Stillwater Orb, Master's Signet, glowing white-gold; under each a thin
; light-spike drives DOWN through the map (the relics all point under Emberfall), and a pale halo pools on the parchment.
; Origin = the ground under the table's centre. 0 lights (emissive only). Relic children are named for `hide` in films.

